<title>USA: ENAP seeks nearly one mln bbls of early Nov crude.</title>
<headline>ENAP seeks nearly one mln bbls of early Nov crude.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's state oil company Empresa Nacional del Petroleo (ENAP) is seeking almost one million barrels of crude oil for delivery in early November, traders said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The purchase tender for 960,000 barrels asked that the oil be delivered November 6-10.</p>
<p>ENAP recently bought Ecuadorian Oriente and West African crudes to meet its requirements.</p>
<p>But traders said Latin American spot crude cargoes were thin as equity sellers in Argentina and Colombia had signed up term contracts lately, reducing supplies.</p>
<p>--Jacqueline Wong, New York Energy Desk +1 212 859 1620</p>
</text>
